# Allowlist: ignore everything, then re-admit only what the website needs.
# Anything new in the folder (notebooks, rasters, keys, scratch files) stays out unless listed here.
*
!.gitignore
!index.html
!summary.csv
!residuals.csv
!ks_mesonet_stations.csv
!boundaries/
!boundaries/kansas_county_bnd.geojson
!png/
!png/faw_*.png
png/faw_200*.png
png/faw_201[0-6]*.png
!reports/
!reports/latest.png
!infographics/
!infographics/*.html
!infographics/*.pdf
infographics/Callihan_ku_0099M_13190_DATA_1.pdf
# Kansas Soil Water Atlas: the page, its figures and its download files (code and data in atlas/ stay out)
!atlas.html
!atlas/
!atlas/img/
!atlas/img/*.png
!atlas/files/
!atlas/files/*.csv
